{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EXO","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"出埃及記","commonName":"出埃及記","title":"出埃及記","order":2,"numberOfChapters":40,"sha256":"61798aad81a685f9835bfe998aedebfde8d4930c7a46a050008db0e45788c359","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EXO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":40,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EXO/40.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1208},"chapter":{"number":11,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["滅長子之災"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對摩西說：「我給法老和埃及再降下一場災難，之後他必放你們走，甚至是把你們徹底趕走。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["你要告訴以色列人，不論男女，去向鄰近的埃及人索取金器銀器。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和華使埃及人恩待以色列人，法老的臣僕和百姓極其尊重摩西。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["摩西說：「耶和華這樣說，『今晚半夜，我要走遍埃及。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["埃及境內，從坐王位的法老的長子到推磨女奴的長子，以及所有頭生的牲畜，都必死亡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那時整個埃及必充滿哭號聲，慘況空前絕後。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["但在以色列人中，連狗也不會向人或牲畜吠叫，這樣你們就知道耶和華把埃及人和以色列人區分開了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["到那時，你所有的臣僕都要來向我下拜，求我和跟隨我的百姓離開這裡。然後我才會離開。』」摩西說完便怒氣沖沖地離開法老。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和華曾對摩西說：「法老一定不肯聽你的話，因此我要在埃及多行神蹟。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["摩西和亞倫在法老面前行了這一切神蹟，但耶和華使法老的心剛硬，他不讓以色列人離開他的國土。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EXO/11.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EXO/12.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EXO/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}